{"3902270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Forager's Finds", "steam_appid": 3902270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your utility belt — it’s time to go foraging.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forager's Finds</i> is a relaxed exploration game where you head into a big, beautiful forest to find, photograph, and collect mushrooms. It's all about slowing down, spotting what's hidden in plain sight, and enjoying the simple satisfaction of discovering something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are loads of species out there — some common, some rare — and it’s your job to find them, learn about them, and build up your own personal journal of discoveries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore a Lively, Open Forest</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through varied terrain — thick woods, gentle hills, damp clearings, rocky slopes. Every area has something different to offer. Some mushrooms are everywhere. Others? You’ll need to look a little harder. Or higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><u>Your Foraging Tools</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve got everything you need strapped to your utility belt:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera</strong> – Take photos of mushrooms in the wild. Every photo helps build your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Journal</strong> – Log what you find and where you found it. Over time, it becomes your go-to guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satchel</strong> – Pick and store your mushrooms to sell later. Limited space means smart choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map</strong> – Keep track of where you’ve been and where you want to return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarity Report</strong> – Unsure what you've picked? This gives you an idea of how rare it is. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell and Upgrade at Forager’s Finds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at your cosy forest shop, you can sell your mushrooms and use the money to get upgrades — like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger satchels</strong> – carry more before heading back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain boots</strong> – reach steeper, more remote areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful perks</strong> – improve your spotting skills or tracking abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take It Slow. Enjoy the Hunt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a race — it’s a game about taking your time. Look closely. Pause often. Take in the sounds, the light, the movement. Whether you're hunting rare finds or just enjoying the calm of the forest, <i>Forager's Finds</i> is your space to explore, learn, and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grab your utility belt — it’s time to go foraging.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forager's Finds</i> is a relaxed exploration game where you head into a big, beautiful forest to find, photograph, and collect mushrooms. It's all about slowing down, spotting what's hidden in plain sight, and enjoying the simple satisfaction of discovering something new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are loads of species out there — some common, some rare — and it’s your job to find them, learn about them, and build up your own personal journal of discoveries.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore a Lively, Open Forest</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander through varied terrain — thick woods, gentle hills, damp clearings, rocky slopes. Every area has something different to offer. Some mushrooms are everywhere. Others? You’ll need to look a little harder. Or higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/766a83518ff90736a9c9ecfce9a6dfb1.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong><u>Your Foraging Tools</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ve got everything you need strapped to your utility belt:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Camera</strong> – Take photos of mushrooms in the wild. Every photo helps build your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Field Journal</strong> – Log what you find and where you found it. Over time, it becomes your go-to guide.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satchel</strong> – Pick and store your mushrooms to sell later. Limited space means smart choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map</strong> – Keep track of where you’ve been and where you want to return.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rarity Report</strong> – Unsure what you've picked? This gives you an idea of how rare it is. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dbc2d44ce7a0e620c608d552845df609.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/587c14589315575e83c9eb642ce7fc72.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/8c8ff97ef2360269a78ed94999dfe563.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sell and Upgrade at Forager’s Finds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back at your cosy forest shop, you can sell your mushrooms and use the money to get upgrades — like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bigger satchels</strong> – carry more before heading back</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mountain boots</strong> – reach steeper, more remote areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helpful perks</strong> – improve your spotting skills or tracking abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.poster.avif?t=1777837989\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.webm?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/extras/dd1d36bce77361fc138570e570b19a93.mp4?t=1777837989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take It Slow. Enjoy the Hunt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a race — it’s a game about taking your time. Look closely. Pause often. Take in the sounds, the light, the movement. Whether you're hunting rare finds or just enjoying the calm of the forest, <i>Forager's Finds</i> is your space to explore, learn, and unwind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Go foraging in a vast forest. Strap on your utility belt and head out to explore, photograph, journal, and pick your finds. Sell them at Forager’s Finds to unlock perks and upgrades. A relaxed mushroom picker simulator with many species to discover and document — if you take the time to look.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/249a9fdc51aebf055e02c3068928e455d99719e5/header.jpg?t=1777837989", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/19041fd901c62ee50b3225cfe49a74b32d7b6521/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777837989", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/19041fd901c62ee50b3225cfe49a74b32d7b6521/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777837989", "website": "https://www.grownowgames.com/forager-s-finds", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GT 1030 / AMD Radeon R7 250 / Intel Iris Xe<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1280 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or compatible sound device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 / AMD RX 580 or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1280 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or compatible sound device</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Grow Now!"], "publishers": ["Grow Now!"], "demos": [{"appid": 3903040, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 79, "description": "Save Anytime"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/f2373ddf3fbd8f759dca45475c3b9274f831a5bf/ss_f2373ddf3fbd8f759dca45475c3b9274f831a5bf.600x338.jpg?t=1777837989", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/f2373ddf3fbd8f759dca45475c3b9274f831a5bf/ss_f2373ddf3fbd8f759dca45475c3b9274f831a5bf.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777837989"}, {"id": 1, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902270/489836a1d46814c3a8f3cf6c5e400bab